senses.gloss:
1. शल् cl. 1. Ā. शलते, ‘to shake’ or ‘to cover’, Dhātup. xiv, 19;
 cl. 1. P. शलति, to go, move, ib. xix, 13 (only found in comp. with prep. cf. उच्-छल्, प्रोच्-छल्, सम्-उच्-छल्);
 cl. 10. Ā. शालयते, to praise, Dhātup. xxxiii, 18; Vop.

शाल् (cf. √ शाड्, which in one sense is v.l.) cl. 1. Ā. शालते, to shine, be distinguished for or endowed with (instr.), Siṃhās.; Śiś., Sch.;
 cl. 1. 10. Ā. शालते, or शालयते, to praise, Dhātup. viii, 37;
 xxxiii, 18 (Vop.)
